BLOCK =  12
     +1234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234
    0|( SLUT ROUTINE AND ROUTINE TO FORCE OTHERS BACK TO INIT POS )   
    1|HEX DATA CKA 0 B,                                               
    2|: SLUT SELF DX@ 0 > IF 0 ELSE 80 THEN ANGLE! ;                  
    3|                                                                
    4|( RETURN UGLY NERDS TO INITIAL POSITION )                       
    5|: FLGEM DO I I:M OBJSV OVB@ MSPRO = IF                          
    6|MSRIP I I:M OBJSV OVB! 1 I I:M MYFLAG OVB! THEN LOOP ;          
    7|( BANISH MONSTERS TO LOWER SCREEN POSITION )                    
